{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01955","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 风月守空闺 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 风月守空闺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良人犹远戍，耿耿夜闺空。\n绣户流宵月，罗帷坐晓风。\n魂飞沙帐北，肠断玉关中。\n尚自无消息，锦衾那得同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}